                                "sense_id": "31476026-c102-39b4-84a9-3e4378b10790",
                                "text": "\"We presume he is reluctant to proceed further and run the risk of exposing his well-varnished cab as a pleasing target for the poles of the loitering omnibuses, the drivers of which latter have obtained a well-earned fame for their dexterity in this diverting and innocent department of toxology.\""
