                                "sense_id": "31476026-c102-39b4-84a9-3e4378b10790",
                                "text": "\"This was provoking : the young lady blushed, looked as amiable as circumstances required,and retired, with a most sincere hope that the next essayist in toxology might have precisely the same success as herself, in which she was gratified, for Miss Jones West Jones Smith Jones Jones made to the full as bad a shot as she had done.\""
                            },
