                                "sense_id": "dd4fc952-5852-3e83-b412-c738462ffe46",
                                "text": "1893, Louisa Parsons Hopkins, \"Women in Science\", in Maud Howe Elliott, ed., Art and Handicraft in the Woman's Building of the World's Columbian Exposition, Chicago, 1893, Goupil & Co., page 91,\nShe filled the chair of chemistry and toxology in the Woman's Medical College of Pennsylvania, and became dean of the faculty."
